    <detaileddescription>
<para>This class encapsulates all the logic for audio capture (PortAudio) and voice recognition processing (Pocketsphinx) in a separate worker thread.</para>
<para>Emits signals when speech is recognized, allowing safe communication with the main thread.</para>
